<title>EGYPT: Egypt share index at sixth straight record close.</title>
<headline>Egypt share index at sixth straight record close.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index jumped 1.22 percent on Sunday to close at a sixth straight record high of 359.64 points, from 355.31 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 12 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
